00:00:06.648 --> 00:00:08.189
VALLIAPPA LAKSHMANAN:
Good afternoon.

00:00:08.189 --> 00:00:09.800
Welcome to Next.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.910
I'm going to be talking about
how to leverage AI on the cloud

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:16.309
so that you can
